# Jupyter DevOps Plan Implementer

Use this rule when the request is to start or continue implementation of the
Jupyter DevOps plan set under `docs/intake/jupyter-devops-implementation-plans/`.

## Trigger Clues

- "start implementing the Jupyter DevOps plans"
- "begin with Plan 00"
- "continue the Jupyter plan work"
- direct references to plans `00` through `05` in that folder

## Required Behavior

- Load `.cursor/skills/jupyter-devops-plan-implementer/SKILL.md`.
- Follow the fixed plan order from Plan 00 through Plan 05.
- Require preview-first validation before mutating deployment work.
- Stop only for destructive actions, unresolved naming or NetBox decisions,
  missing secrets, or failed validations that need a user decision.
